 "drivingQuestion": "Did Rabban Gamliel permit raising small cattle against the mishna?",
 "outcome": "resolved",
 "outcomeNote": "the baraita is emended to 'keeping', removing the contradiction",
 "continuesQuestionOf": null,
 "segments": [
  {
   "id": "bava_kamma.80a.2",
   "daf": "80a",
   "sentenceId": 1,
   "he": "שָׁאֲלוּ תַּלְמִידָיו אֶת רַבָּן גַּמְלִיאֵל: מַהוּ לְגַדֵּל? אָמַר לָהֶן: מוּתָּר. וְהָתְנַן: אֵין מְגַדְּלִין!",
   "en": "«His students asked Rabban Gamliel: What is» the halakha «with regard to raising» small domesticated animals in Eretz Yisrael? Rabban Gamliel «said to them: It is permitted.» The Gemara interrupts its citation of the baraita to pose a question: How could Rabban Gamliel say this? «But didn’t we learn» in the mishna: «One may not raise» small domesticated animals in Eretz Yisrael?"
  },
  {
   "id": "bava_kamma.80a.3",
   "daf": "80a",
   "sentenceId": 2,
   "he": "אֶלָּא הָכִי קָא בָּעוּ מִינֵּיהּ: מַהוּ לְשַׁהוֹת? אָמַר לָהֶן: מוּתָּר, וּבִלְבַד שֶׁלֹּא תֵּצֵא וְתִרְעֶה בָּעֵדֶר; אֶלָּא קוֹשְׁרָהּ בְּכַרְעֵי הַמִּטָּה.",
   "en": "«Rather,» the text of the baraita must be emended, and «they» actually «raised this dilemma before him: What is» the halakha «with regard to keeping» them for a while? The Gemara resumes the quotation of the baraita: Rabban Gamliel «said to them:» It is «permitted, provided that» the animal «does not go out and graze among the flock. Rather,» one should «tie it to the legs of the bed» in his house."
  }
 ],
